# The tri-fold card of the TeX math symbols: landscape, one sheet of two
# sides, three panels on each side (six panels).  The symbols are in the
# list that the last line names, which the generator turns into the panels;
# the first side is the outside of the sheet and its last panel is the cover.
.doc Strata Math Symbols
.landscape
# The margins are 0.2 inch on all four sides (the sheet is turned, so the
# right margin of the sheet is the top margin of the page).  The panels of
# the first two columns have the widths 33 and 35 cells, which put the rules
# between the panels at a third and two thirds of the sheet; the last panel
# takes what is left.
.margins 0.2 0.2 0.2 0.2
.keyscale 0.7
.numbering off
.linespace 1.0
.h1 Strata math symbols
.mathsyms mathsyms.txt
